<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="7123bda6">&lt;p&gt;
    This task is performed in order to:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Test content and delivery process with select stakeholders to gain feedback
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Evaluate effectiveness of training materials and preparation of instructors
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Refine training content and delivery process before full deployment
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Identify and resolve training issues before&amp;nbsp;deployment&amp;nbsp;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
